   lib/src/crdt/object_replay.dart and lib/src/crdt/store_slice.dart were
   written to reproduce anytype-heart's state building (BuildState,
   applyChange and slice.ApplyChanges) and may derive from anytype-heart.
   They are distributed under the Any Source Available License 1.0 (ASAL),
